<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" pages="3">
  <diagram id="uTrubnbHI4GOdjIVK2WH" name="HU-01">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3242" dy="2442" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User as Usuario\n    participant Screen as ReportFormScreen (UI)\n    participant Hook as useReportForm (Hook)\n    participant LocService as LocationAdapter (GPS/Map)\n    participant MediaService as MediaAdapter (Cámara/Compress)\n    participant OutboxRepo as OutboxRepository (SQLite Cifrado)\n    participant Api as ApiClient (HTTP)\n    participant Ctrl as ReportsController (NestJS)\n    participant Svc as ReportsService\n    participant DB as PostgreSQL (PostGIS)\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;Screen: Completa datos del evento (tipo, gravedad, fecha)\n    \n    opt Toma o selecciona fotografía (Opcional)\n        User-&gt;&gt;Screen: Pulsa \&quot;Adjuntar foto\&quot;\n        Screen-&gt;&gt;MediaService: pickAndCompressImage()\n        MediaService--&gt;&gt;Screen: foto comprimida (&lt; 1 MB)\n    end\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;Screen: Selecciona ubicación (GPS o mapa manual)\n    Screen-&gt;&gt;LocService: getCurrentPosition()\n    LocService--&gt;&gt;Screen: { lat, lon, accuracy }\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;Screen: Presiona \&quot;Enviar Reporte\&quot;\n    Screen-&gt;&gt;Hook: submitReport(formData)\n    \n    Note over Hook: Genera clientReportId (UUID)&lt;br/&gt;e Idempotency-Key\n    Hook-&gt;&gt;OutboxRepo: save({ clientReportId, payload, photoPath, status: &#39;SYNC_PENDING&#39; })\n    OutboxRepo--&gt;&gt;Hook: guardado local OK\n\n    alt Hay conexión a Internet\n        Hook-&gt;&gt;Api: createReport(multipart: payload + photo, Idempotency-Key)\n        Api-&gt;&gt;Ctrl: POST /v1/reports\n        Ctrl-&gt;&gt;Svc: createReport(dto, photoFile)\n        Svc-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT INTO report ... (status: &#39;PENDING&#39;)\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Svc: ReportEntity\n        Svc--&gt;&gt;Ctrl: ReportReceipt\n        Ctrl--&gt;&gt;Api: HTTP 201 Created\n        Api--&gt;&gt;Hook: receipt\n        Hook-&gt;&gt;OutboxRepo: markSynced(clientReportId)\n        Hook--&gt;&gt;Screen: { status: &#39;SUCCESS&#39;, sync: &#39;ONLINE&#39; }\n    else Sin conexión (Offline)\n        Note over Hook: ApiClient falla o detecta offline\n        Hook--&gt;&gt;Screen: { status: &#39;SUCCESS&#39;, sync: &#39;SAVED_LOCALLY&#39; }\n    end\n\n    Screen--&gt;&gt;User: Muestra mensaje de éxito / confirmación&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="a1YvwnJc7J23N0_PH-Mh-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="1630" width="2616" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
