      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User as Usuario (Visitante)\n    box rgba(50, 100, 200, 0.1) Frontend (React Native)\n        participant Screen as PublicMapScreen\n        participant Hook as usePublicReports\n        participant API as API Client\n    end\n\n    box rgba(70, 160, 70, 0.1) Backend (Spring Boot)\n        participant Ctrl as PublicReportsController\n        participant Svc as ReportsService\n        participant Repo as PublicReportRepository\n    end\n\n    participant DB as PostgreSQL / PostGIS\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;Screen: Abre el mapa público\n    Screen-&gt;&gt;Hook: usePublicReports(filters)\n    Note over Hook: isLoading = true\n    Hook-&gt;&gt;API: getPublicReports(params)\n    API-&gt;&gt;Ctrl: HTTP GET /v1/public/reports\n    Ctrl-&gt;&gt;Svc: getVerifiedReports(filterDto)\n    Svc-&gt;&gt;Repo: findPublicReports()\n    Repo-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT * FROM public_verified_report\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Repo: Registros con approximate_location (grid 500m)\n    Repo--&gt;&gt;Svc: List&lt;PublicReportEntity&gt;\n    Note over Svc: Mapeo a PublicReportDTO[]&lt;br/&gt;(Sin PII, sin fotos, coord. aproximada)\n    Svc--&gt;&gt;Ctrl: PublicReportResponseDTO\n    Ctrl--&gt;&gt;API: HTTP 200 OK (JSON)\n    API--&gt;&gt;Hook: PublicReportDTO[]\n    Note over Hook: isLoading = false, reports = PublicReportDTO[]\n    Hook--&gt;&gt;Screen: { reports, isLoading: false }\n    Screen--&gt;&gt;User: Renderiza chinchetas aproximadas en el mapa&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="SFY6fhgr8n63YjB1XOew-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
